#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "The Worker is one way to call /ingress/email. Any mail server or relay can post the raw message with the same signed headers, and a mail server that delivers to a command can pipe the message into yuva ingest-email. The request format is documented in the Worker's README."
msgstr "Worker je en način klica /ingress/email. Kateri koli poštni strežnik ali rele lahko pošlje surovo sporočilo z istimi podpisanimi glavami, poštni strežnik, ki dostavlja ukazu, pa lahko sporočilo prek cevi preda yuva ingest-email. Oblika zahteve je dokumentirana v README Workerja."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "The Worker signs the raw message, both envelope addresses and a timestamp with HMAC-SHA256 under a secret you share with Yuva, and sends them to /ingress/email on your Yuva server."
msgstr "Worker podpiše surovo sporočilo, oba naslova ovojnice in časovni žig s HMAC-SHA256 s skrivnostjo, ki jo delite z Yuvo, ter jih pošlje na /ingress/email na vašem strežniku Yuva."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "The Yuva chat widget open on a newsletter tool's website: the visitor's question and a member's reply, with the member shown online."
msgstr "Yuvin vtičnik za klepet, odprt na spletnem mestu orodja za novičnike: vprašanje obiskovalca in odgovor člana, član je prikazan kot na spletu."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "The Yuva Email Worker reads the raw message and the envelope, signs the request and posts it to Yuva. Parsing, threading and spam decisions stay on the server."
msgstr "Yuva Email Worker prebere surovo sporočilo in ovojnico, podpiše zahtevo in jo pošlje Yuvi. Razčlenjevanje, nitenje in odločitve o neželeni pošti ostanejo na strežniku."

